      <description>
        <![CDATA[<h1>More SQLi writeup</h1><p>作者：Zhi Chen（ray784523@zhienw.com）</p>
        
          <h2 id="解題">
<a class="header-anchor" href="#%e8%a7%a3%e9%a1%8c"></a>
